{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Friends.</b> Like \"violent adversaries,\" and the witness to it is להתרועע. Or the yod is a formative letter, on the pattern of גאים, and רע on the pattern of גא מאד — meaning, a man should love friends, so that they associate with him and join him, for there is a lover who cleaves more than a brother."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:34.249683535Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}